<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian internal security forces arrested a deposed regime officer linked to the al-Otaiba massacre and detained an ex-general accused of the 2014 Ghouta ambush. EgyptAir announced it will restart direct flights to Damascus and Aleppo in December, signaling a tentative reopening of civilian links. Syria, Jordan, Iraq and Lebanon signed an agricultural pact aimed at boosting regional food security. Sanctions relief for Syria is confronting deep structural challenges, while the country bears costs from the Iran war. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd0k4MkFvZUNzUmQ3SFlLTC1wU3JtU1FpWWl0a0V1RDVwRjJ1b2I2Yl9JT1lxclhPOEJ0QnBLTDJrY013T3REUDNtd1FxRlhjMFp3alJlNV9aVHo2T2Q0U1ljRHVMOVdKWHdpb05LU3pqVk1IeUxGeFJrNG5ZaVJIQ2E0Um00RWZNWl9TemVxSzgtWjcyb1Z5VWZ6T3pHcENnZ2t5TlI0XzF0T1JOc3RFRTU3dk9TdlEz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE82MEhKTi1BUVBaaG9NRkFHeGdoYk9ObDFzaDkxclhWZ0QyaHZIY3NkVjJkMEVwUUtQci1KUjRYTjkydjBQTV9LYlRmcXdnZEVqSnowMVg3NjFPUkloLVRtMzRjZEFOVlhCUmJvTXBDWU5XcGtBMEtHR2xRbG44OXZZdWlGdkF3d0YxZlFQLWUyTnBTalJzc1FwUVEzQXp1OVNJbWtMOXJLVnNheDdvcUdReUhNakxiOVJlN201UFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPUF9hcHp6YWxsM1J4M01HMkZCa2EyR0JKUldGdXpVcTZFdDZDdEhXazFaZjB6OEpUeDQ0NXhxWDQ0SW4xTVh3STBKUUp4RzJNbzlZSEVXTTNWektvT2F5TTdhb2NxN2RNdWM1eGpCNjVqXzhYSFpnVkthYzUwQ3BYUF95OG9rbHFxUFYycU52eUlzclpEaWlSNG5QUTJwN3NBb25oNEhVN1ZGSzBsMHVtMDUzd3pkYUJpUGlZV19laVVJSWpKS0NHcTlR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiX0FVX3lxTFB5dTdnUlJ3Sm9BeUVLNTJaRWVBMWNiamUwX3FJQi1nQUVWblNlMFVPQUNCOXdJYmhqZElZYnZUdXVFRTlndGg0eEYwVXhZeW1JOWNQb0NuZXVZOXZyUWp3?oc=5&quot;&gt